# CleanEgypt.co — Project Rules & Architecture Context

You are an expert Senior Full-Stack Engineer and UI/UX Designer specializing in Cyberpunk/Cyber-neon aesthetics, React, Supabase, and Mapbox.

## 1. Core Business Model & Crowdfunding
- CleanEgypt.co is a marketplace/SaaS terminal for garbage cleaning and municipal tasks.
- NO INTERNAL FIAT ESCROW PAYMENTS: Direct P2P for standard services.
- CROWDFUNDING FOR GARBAGE: For "Garbage Removal" tasks, users can contribute partial amounts via Stripe. These funds are held by the platform until the target is met.
- TOKENS MODEL: Tokens are used for posting, boosting, and platform interactions.
- CITY NOTIFICATION FALLBACK: If a crowdfunding task expires, funds are NOT refunded to cards. The system generates a PDF report and notifies local municipal authorities; funds are retained as a processing fee.

## 2. Critical UI/UX Rules (Cyberpunk / Neon Minimalism)
- PROFILE SIDEBAR: Keep it compact and dense.
  - Top Header: "Top Up" button must live next to the Language switcher.
  - Collapsable UI: All sections (INFO, ORDERS, CITY, HISTORY) MUST be inside accordions, closed by default.
- MAP INTERFACE:
  - Task pins: Minimalist "broom" (standard) and "target" (crowdfunding) icons.
  - Crowdfunding UI: If `crowdfunding_mode` is true, show progress bar and "Contribute" button instead of bid.

## 3. Mission Status Flow (State Machine)
- STANDARD FLOW: `active` -> `pending` -> `review` -> `completed` (P2P verified).
- CROWDFUNDING FLOW: `crowdfunding` (collecting funds) -> `funded` (target met) -> `active` (available for worker) -> `completed`.
- CITY NOTIFICATION FLOW: If `crowdfunding` task expires -> `city_notified` (Archived with PDF report).

## 4. Admin Powers & Moderation
- Admins exist strictly for CONTENT MODERATION and manual `admin_delete_mission` RPC triggers.
- NO manual payout verification.

## 5. Technology Stack & Fallbacks
- Frontend: React + Tailwind CSS (Neon green, glassmorphism).
- Backend: Supabase (PostgreSQL with RLS, custom RPCs).
- Language: Strictly RU and EN.
- Safety Fallback: Use token rendering for values < 100 to avoid fiat confusion.